# Minimal inittab for an 8 MB no-MMU system: no rcS daemons (each resident process holds its
# own copy of the busybox flat binary), no getty/login, just a shell on the console.
::sysinit:/bin/mount -t proc proc /proc
::sysinit:/bin/mount -t sysfs sysfs /sys
console::respawn:-/bin/sh
::shutdown:/bin/umount -a -r
